@startuml
!include style.puml
' PlantUML paints each trace from a palette. Monochrome keeps the trace a dark stroke.
' The state name stays the mark. See references/style.md.
skinparam monochrome true
title When the order and the payment change during the charge

robust "Order" as order
robust "Payment" as payment

@0
order is Draft
payment is Absent
@100
order is Confirmed
@200
payment is Authorizing
@300
payment is Authorized
order is Paid
@enduml
